{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an rna_only model with multiprofile settings and avgpool aggregation, isolating the impact of profile configuration without multimodal data. Validation accuracy (0.5907) and F1 (0.5727) are higher than previous multimodal baselines, suggesting multiprofile may improve performance. Uncertainty remains about the optimal aggregation method and whether other components like fusion strategies could further enhance results."
}

